OL,3,GNEWSA#1m funding to tackle rough
OL,4,Asleeping by Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #1m has been given to York
OL,7,Fand North Yorkshire to get rough
OL,8,Fsleepers off the streets by Christmas.
OL,10,FThe money from the government comes
OL,11,Fafter the prime minister pledged to end
OL,12,Frough sleeping across the country when
OL,13,Fhe first entered Downing Street in the
OL,14,Fsummer.
OL,16,FThe funding, given to the combined
OL,17,Fauthority from the Ministry of Housing,
OL,18,FCommunities and Local Government
OL,19,F(MCLG), has been split between City of
OL,20,FYork Council and North Yorkshire
OL,21,FCouncil in the first year of the
OL,22,Fthree-year scheme.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
