OL,3,GNEWSA#1m funding to tackle rough
OL,4,Asleeping by Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Skaith, mayor of York and North
OL,7,FYorkshire, said the extra funding would
OL,8,Ftackle the "root causes that prevent
OL,9,Fpeople getting the support they need".
